Methodology_notes_Table_1_-_Revisions_to_UK_exports_for_January_2026_to_July_2026.ods","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9541917","isbn":"","title":"Methodology notes Table 1: Revisions to UK exports for January 2026 to July 2026","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6acc8db8b016250bca013ba0/Methodology_notes_Table_1_-_Revisions_to_UK_exports_for_January_2026_to_July_2026.ods"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"different.format@hmrc.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6acc8dcdb016250bca013ba1","filename":"Methodology_notes_Table_2_-_Revisions_to_UK_imports_for_January_2026_to_July_2026.ods"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.spreadsheet","file_size":11824,"filename":"Methodology_notes_Table_2_-_Revisions_to_UK_imports_for_January_2026_to_July_2026.ods","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9541918","isbn":"","title":"Methodology notes Table 2: Revisions to UK imports for January 2026 to July 2026","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6acc8dcdb016250bca013ba1/Methodology_notes_Table_2_-_Revisions_to_UK_imports_for_January_2026_to_July_2026.ods"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>The tables previously available with this release are now published as a separate <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/uk-overseas-trade-statistics-and-regional-trade-statistics\">statistical data set</a>. </p>\n\n<p>HM Revenue &amp; Customs (<abbr title=\"HM Revenue &amp; Customs \">HMRC</abbr>) collects the <abbr title=\"United Kingdom\">UK</abbr>’s international trade in goods data, which is published as an Accredited official statistics series - the <abbr title=\"United Kingdom\">UK</abbr> overseas trade in goods statistics (<abbr title=\" UK overseas trade in goods statistics \">OTS</abbr>). Data for <abbr title=\" non-European Union \">non-EU</abbr> and <abbr title=\"European Union\">EU</abbr> trade are published simultaneously on a monthly basis. The <abbr title=\" UK overseas trade in goods statistics \">OTS</abbr> publications include import and export trade values by summary product and partner country. </p>\n\n<p>Downloadable versions of the <abbr title=\"United Kingdom\">UK</abbr> overseas trade in goods statistics data sets, exporters and importers details are available from uktradeinfo’s <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.uktradeinfo.com/trade-data/latest-bulk-data-sets/\">Latest bulk data sets</a> page. </p>\n\n<h2 id=\"interactive-data\"> Interactive Data </h2>\n\n<p><abbr title=\"United Kingdom\">UK</abbr> overseas trade in goods statistics data is also accessible in greater product and partner country detail in an <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.uktradeinfo.com/trade-data/\">interactive table with an extensive archive</a>. </p>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-10-15T08:30:01Z"}],"document_type_label":"Accredited official statistics","emphasised_organisations":["6667cce2-e809-4e21-ae09-cb0bdc1ddda3"],"featured_attachments":["9535088","9535089","9541919","9541920","9541926","9541921","9541927","9541922","9541928","9541923","9541929","9541924","9541930","9541925","9541931","9541932","9541917","9541918"],"first_public_at":"2026-10-15T09:30:01.000+01:00","political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"national_statistics","first_published_at":"2026-10-15T09:30:01+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/statistics/uk-overseas-trade-in-goods-statistics-august-2026","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/statistics/uk-overseas-trade-in-goods-statistics-august-2026","base_path":"/government/statistics/uk-overseas-trade-in-goods-statistics-august-2026","content_id":"c3af81c6-8ba2-4cce-8783-05606b02e98c","document_type":"national_s